---
// src/pages/nexus.astro - SGA Strategic Intelligence Hub (Consulting Deck v2.0 - Justified Edition)
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@200..1000&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Nexus Audit | Brainstorming Methodology</title>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-100 font-sans min-h-screen p-4 md:p-12 pb-24 lg:pb-12 overflow-x-hidden">

<div class="fixed inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden bg-[#020617]">
    <div class="absolute -top-[20%] -left-[20%] w-[120%] h-[120%] bg-indigo-500/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full animate-mesh-slow"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-[20%] -right-[20%] w-[110%] h-[110%] bg-blue-600/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full animate-mesh-slow" style="animation-delay: -3s;"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none" style="background-image: radial-gradient(#ffffff 0.5px, transparent 0.5px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
</div>

<aside class="h-fit fixed bottom-0 left-0 w-full lg:w-auto lg:left-6 lg:top-1/2 lg:-translate-y-1/2 z-[100] bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur-xl border-t lg:border border-slate-800 p-3 lg:rounded-2xl shadow-[0_-10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] lg:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] transition-all">
    <div class="flex flex-row lg:flex-col gap-4 md:gap-5 w-full justify-around lg:justify-start items-center h-fit overflow-x-auto lg:overflow-visible no-scrollbar px-2 lg:px-0">

        <a href="/" class="group relative flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 hover:border-orange-400 text-slate-400 hover:text-orange-400 transition-all hover:scale-105">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
            <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-16 invisible opacity-0 group-hover:visible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none text-black z-[200]">
                <div class="bg-orange-500 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-2xl border border-orange-400/50 whitespace-nowrap">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest">Tactical Stats</p>
                    <p class="text-[8px] font-bold opacity-70 uppercase leading-none mt-1">Live Telemetry</p>
                </div>
                <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-1 -translate-y-1/2 w-2 h-2 bg-orange-500 rotate-45"></div>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/rig-manifest" class="group relative flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-400 text-slate-400 hover:text-blue-400 transition-all hover:scale-105">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2zM9 9h6v6H9V9z" /></svg>
            <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-16 invisible opacity-0 group-hover:visible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none text-white z-[200]">
                <div class="bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-2xl border border-blue-400/50 whitespace-nowrap">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest">Rig Manifest</p>
                    <p class="text-[8px] font-bold opacity-70 uppercase leading-none mt-1">Hardware ID</p>
                </div>
                <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-1 -translate-y-1/2 w-2 h-2 bg-blue-600 rotate-45"></div>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/nexus" class="group relative flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-white shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(79,70,229,0.4)] border border-indigo-400/50 scale-110 transition-all">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8h2a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2v4l-4-4H9a1.994 1.994 0 01-1.414-.586m0 0L11 14h4a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2v4l.586-.586z" /></svg>
            <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-16 invisible opacity-0 group-hover:visible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none text-white z-[200]">
                <div class="bg-indigo-600 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-2xl border border-indigo-400/50 whitespace-nowrap">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest">Nexus Hub</p>
                    <p class="text-[8px] font-bold opacity-70 uppercase leading-none mt-1">Team Ideation</p>
                </div>
                <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-1 -translate-y-1/2 w-2 h-2 bg-indigo-600 rotate-45"></div>
            </div>
        </a>

        <div class="w-[1px] h-8 lg:w-8 lg:h-[1px] bg-slate-800/50 mx-1 lg:mx-0"></div>

        <a href="/forge" class="group relative flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 hover:border-emerald-400 text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-all hover:scale-105">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 4a2 2 0 114 0v1a1 1 0 001 1h3a1 1 0 011 1v3a1 1 0 01-1 1h-1a2 2 0 100 4h1a1 1 0 011 1v3a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3a1 1 0 00-1 1v1a2 2 0 11-4 0v-1a1 1 0 00-1-1H7a1 1 0 01-1-1v-3a1 1 0 011-1h1a2 2 0 100-4H7a1 1 0 01-1-1V7a1 1 0 011-1h3a1 1 0 001-1V4z" /></svg>
            <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-16 invisible opacity-0 group-hover:visible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none text-white z-[200]">
                <div class="bg-emerald-600 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-2xl border border-emerald-400/50 whitespace-nowrap">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest">The Forge</p>
                    <p class="text-[8px] font-bold opacity-70 uppercase leading-none mt-1">Custom Assembly</p>
                </div>
                <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-1 -translate-y-1/2 w-2 h-2 bg-emerald-600 rotate-45"></div>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/store" class="group relative flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-100 text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-100 transition-all hover:scale-105">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z" /></svg>
            <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-16 invisible opacity-0 group-hover:visible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none text-white z-[200]">
                <div class="bg-slate-700 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-2xl border border-slate-600 whitespace-nowrap">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest">SGA Store</p>
                    <p class="text-[8px] font-bold opacity-70 uppercase leading-none mt-1">Retail Access</p>
                </div>
                <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-1 -translate-y-1/2 w-2 h-2 bg-slate-700 rotate-45"></div>
            </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/booking" class="group relative flex flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 hover:border-purple-400 text-slate-400 hover:text-purple-400 transition-all hover:scale-105">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
            <div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-16 invisible opacity-0 group-hover:visible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none text-white z-[200]">
                <div class="bg-purple-600 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-2xl border border-purple-400/50 whitespace-nowrap">
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest">Consulting</p>
                    <p class="text-[8px] font-bold opacity-70 uppercase leading-none mt-1">Book Session</p>
                </div>
                <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-1 -translate-y-1/2 w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rotate-45"></div>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
</aside>

<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto lg:pl-20">
    <header class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center mb-16 border-b border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <div>
            <h1 style="font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;" class="text-3xl tracking-tighter text-white font-black uppercase italic leading-none">
                Nexus <span class="font-light opacity-50 text-indigo-400 font-sans">Intelligence</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-slate-500 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mt-3" id="uplink-status">Secure Handshake in Progress...</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-6 md:mt-0">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1 bg-slate-900/50 p-1 rounded-xl border border-slate-800">
                <a href="https://wa.me/yournumber" target="_blank" title="WhatsApp" class="p-2 text-slate-500 hover:text-emerald-500 transition-all">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M13.601 2.326A7.854 7.854 0 0 0 7.994 0C3.627 0 .068 3.558.064 7.926c0 1.399.366 2.76 1.06 3.978l-1.127 4.117 4.212-1.105a7.86 7.86 0 0 0 3.79.975h.004c4.368 0 7.926-3.558 7.93-7.93A7.898 7.898 0 0 0 13.6 2.326zM7.994 14.521a6.573 6.573 0 0 1-3.356-.92l-.24-.144-2.494.654.666-2.433-.156-.251a6.56 6.56 0 0 1-1.007-3.505c0-3.626 2.957-6.584 6.591-6.584a6.56 6.56 0 0 1 4.66 1.931 6.557 6.557 0 0 1 1.928 4.66c-.004 3.639-2.961 6.592-6.592 6.592zm3.615-4.934c-.197-.099-1.17-.578-1.353-.646-.182-.065-.315-.099-.445.099-.133.197-.513.646-.627.775-.114.133-.232.148-.43.05-.197-.1-.836-.308-1.592-.985-.59-.525-.985-1.175-1.103-1.372-.114-.198-.011-.304.088-.403.087-.088.197-.232.296-.346.1-.114.133-.198.198-.33.065-.134.034-.248-.015-.347-.05-.099-.445-1.076-.612-1.47-.16-.389-.323-.335-.445-.34-.114-.007-.247-.007-.38-.007a.729.729 0 0 0-.529.247c-.182.198-.691.677-.691 1.654 0 .977.71 1.916.81 2.049.098.133 1.394 2.132 3.383 2.992.47.205.84.326 1.129.418.475.152.904.129 1.246.08.38-.058 1.171-.48 1.338-.943.164-.464.164-.86.114-.943-.049-.084-.182-.133-.38-.232z"/></svg>
                </a>
                <a href="https://instagram.com/yourprofile" target="_blank" title="Instagram" class="p-2 text-slate-500 hover:text-pink-500 transition-all">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 0C5.829 0 5.556.01 4.703.048 3.85.088 3.269.222 2.76.42a3.917 3.917 0 0 0-1.417.923A3.927 3.927 0 0 0 .42 2.76C.222 3.268.087 3.85.048 4.7.01 5.555 0 5.827 0 8.001c0 2.172.01 2.444.048 3.297.04.852.174 1.433.372 1.942.205.526.478.972.923 1.417.444.445.89.719 1.416.923.51.198 1.09.333 1.942.372C5.555 15.99 5.827 16 8 16s2.444-.01 3.298-.048c.851-.04 1.434-.174 1.943-.372a3.916 3.916 0 0 0 1.416-.923c.445-.445.718-.891.923-1.417.197-.509.332-1.09.372-1.942C15.99 10.445 16 10.173 16 8s-.01-2.445-.048-3.299c-.04-.851-.175-1.433-.372-1.941a3.926 3.926 0 0 0-.923-1.417A3.911 3.911 0 0 0 13.24.42c-.51-.198-1.092-.333-1.943-.372C10.443.01 10.172 0 7.998 0h.003zm-.717 1.442h.718c2.136 0 2.389.007 3.232.046.78.035 1.204.166 1.486.275.373.145.64.319.92.599.28.28.453.546.598.92.11.281.24.705.275 1.485.039.843.047 1.096.047 3.231s-.008 2.389-.047 3.232c-.035.78-.166 1.203-.275 1.485a2.47 2.47 0 0 1-.599.919c-.28.28-.546.453-.92.598-.28.11-.704.24-1.485.276-.843.038-1.096.047-3.232.047s-2.39-.009-3.233-.047c-.78-.036-1.203-.166-1.485-.276a2.478 2.478 0 0 1-.92-.598 2.48 2.48 0 0 1-.6-.92c-.109-.281-.24-.705-.275-1.485-.038-.843-.046-1.096-.046-3.233 0-2.136.008-2.388.046-3.231.036-.78.166-1.204.276-1.486.145-.373.319-.64.599-.92.28-.28.546-.453.92-.598.282-.11.705-.24 1.485-.276.738-.034 1.024-.044 2.515-.045v.002zm4.988 1.328a.96.96 0 1 0 0 1.92.96.96 0 0 0 0-1.92zm-4.27 1.122a4.109 4.109 0 1 0 0 8.217 4.109 4.109 0 0 0 0-8.217zm0 1.441a2.667 2.667 0 1 1 0 5.334 2.667 2.667 0 0 1 0-5.334z"/></svg>
                </a>
                <a href="https://t.me/yourid" target="_blank" title="Telegram" class="p-2 text-slate-500 hover:text-sky-500 transition-all">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                        <path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12s5.37 12 12 12 12-5.37 12-12S18.63 0 12 0zm5.56 8.16l-1.93 9.1c-.14.64-.52.79-1.06.49l-2.95-2.17-1.42 1.37c-.16.16-.29.29-.6.29l.2-3 5.46-4.93c.24-.22-.05-.34-.37-.13l-6.74 4.25-2.9-.91c-.63-.2-1.1-.52-.13-.88l11.31-4.36c.53-.2 1-.12.86.87z"/>
                    </svg>
                </a>
                <a href="https://github.com/yourusername" target="_blank" title="GitHub" class="p-2 text-slate-500 hover:text-white transition-all">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.012 8.012 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
                </a>
                <a href="mailto:support@sgatech.com" title="Email Support" class="p-2 text-slate-500 hover:text-orange-500 transition-all">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
                </a>

                <div id="auth-container" class="flex items-center border-l border-slate-800 ml-1 pl-1">
                    <a href="/about" title="About SGA" class="p-2 text-slate-500 hover:text-orange-500 transition-all">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
                        </svg>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/signin" id="login-btn" class="p-2 text-slate-500 hover:text-indigo-400 transition-all">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
                        </svg>
                    </a>
                    <div id="user-badge" class="hidden items-center gap-2 px-2 border-l border-slate-800/50">
                        <span id="user-email" class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-500">...</span>
                        <button id="logout-btn" class="p-1 text-slate-600 hover:text-red-500 transition-colors">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 16l4-4m0 0l-4-4m4 4H7m6 4v1a3 3 0 01-3 3H6a3 3 0 01-3-3V7a3 3 0 013-3h4a3 3 0 013 3v1" /></svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-24 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-4 duration-1000">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase leading-[0.9] text-white mb-10 text-justify">
            Unstructured Collaboration <br/> <span class="text-indigo-500">Actively Limits</span> <br/> Throughput.
        </h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
            <div class="bg-slate-900/60 p-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
                <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Internal Audit: Process Loss</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-6 italic text-justify">
                    The phenomenon of **Process Loss** occurs when the interaction between group members inhibits performance, resulting in a collective output that is inferior to the sum of individual efforts.
                </p>
                <ul class="space-y-4">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-tight">
                        <span class="text-indigo-500 font-bold">[01]</span> <strong>Production Blocking:</strong> Sequential speech prevents parallel cognitive execution.
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-tight">
                        <span class="text-indigo-500 font-bold">[02]</span> <strong>Evaluation Apprehension:</strong> Peer-judgment triggers immediate self-censorship.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
                <div class="bg-indigo-950/20 border border-indigo-500/20 p-8 rounded-[2rem] relative">
                    <div class="mb-4 flex justify-between items-end">
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase">Ideation Efficiency</span>
                        <span class="text-2xl font-black text-indigo-400">42%</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-full bg-slate-800 h-2 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-6">
                        <div class="bg-indigo-500 h-full w-[42%] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(99,102,241,0.5)]"></div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed font-mono uppercase tracking-tighter text-justify">
                        *Traditional brainstorming groups under-perform nominal groups by approx. 58% due to social interference.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-24 p-10 bg-slate-900/30 rounded-[3rem] border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-md">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase leading-[0.95] text-white mb-12 text-justify">
            Systematic <span class="text-indigo-400">Divergence</span> <br/> is the Primary Catalyst.
        </h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="p-6 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl">
                <span class="text-xs font-black text-indigo-500 mb-2 block uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Rule 01</span>
                <p class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2 uppercase">Defer Judgment</p>
                <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs text-justify">Abolish criticism during the generation phase to eliminate the fear barrier.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-2xl">
                <span class="text-xs font-black text-indigo-500 mb-2 block uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Rule 02</span>
                <p class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-2 uppercase">Prioritize Volume</p>
